B.byQ=s(["Lyen retou pou reyinisyalizasyon an poko konfigire sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019URL de retour de r\xe9initialisation n\u2019est pas configur\xe9e sur le serveur.","The password-reset redirect URL is not configured on the server."],t.s)
B.blG=s(["Pa gen pwopriyet\xe8 aktif pou sal sa a.","Aucun propri\xe9taire actif pour cette salle.","This gym has no active owner."],t.s)
B.bko=s(["Im\xe8l sa a deja gen yon kont. Chwazi yon l\xf2t im\xe8l; aplikasyon an pa transfere kont ant sal yo.","Cet email poss\xe8de d\xe9j\xe0 un compte. Choisissez un autre email ; l\u2019application ne transf\xe8re pas les comptes entre salles.","This email already has an account. Choose another email; accounts are not transferred between gyms."],t.s)
